---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="开发工具箱"><section class="wrap page-section"><p class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER UTILITIES</p><h1 class="page-title">专注开发，省下换算。</h1><p class="page-lead">几件顺手的小工具。所有计算都在你的浏览器中完成。</p><div class="tool-grid">
<section class="tool-card"><h2>进制转换</h2><p>支持二、八、十、十六进制与大整数。</p><label for="radix">输入进制</label><select id="radix"><option value="16">十六进制 HEX</option><option value="10">十进制 DEC</option><option value="2">二进制 BIN</option><option value="8">八进制 OCT</option></select><label for="base-value">数值</label><input id="base-value" value="FF" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"/><output id="base-result" class="tool-result" aria-live="polite"></output><p class="tool-hint">负数以数学符号表示，不自动转换为补码。</p></section>
<section class="tool-card"><h2>定时器更新频率</h2><p>根据 PSC 和 ARR，计算向上计数的更新频率。</p><label for="timer-clock">定时器输入时钟 fTIM（MHz）</label><input id="timer-clock" type="number" value="72" min="0.001" step="any"/><div class="input-pair"><div><label for="timer-psc">预分频 PSC</label><input id="timer-psc" type="number" value="71" min="0" max="65535" step="1"/></div><div><label for="timer-arr">自动重装载 ARR</label><input id="timer-arr" type="number" value="999" min="1" max="4294967295" step="1"/></div></div><output id="timer-result" class="tool-result" aria-live="polite"></output><p class="tool-hint">f = fTIM / ((PSC+1) × (ARR+1))。使用实际定时器时钟；不适用于中心对齐或含重复计数器的情况。16 位定时器 ARR 最大为 65535。</p></section>
<section class="tool-card"><h2>CRC-16 / MODBUS</h2><p>检查一段报文，显示校验值和线上字节顺序。</p><label for="crc-data">十六进制字节</label><textarea id="crc-data" spellcheck="false">01 03 00 00 00 0A</textarea><output id="crc-result" class="tool-result" aria-live="polite"></output><p class="tool-hint">初始值 FFFF · 反射多项式 A001 · 无最终异或 · 低字节先发送。</p></section>
<section class="tool-card"><h2>位掩码查看器</h2><p>选择 8 位寄存器中的位置，生成十六进制掩码。</p><fieldset><legend>选择置 1 的位</legend><div class="bit-controls">{Array.from({length:8},(_,i)=>7-i).map(i=><label class="bit-label"><span>bit {i}</span><input type="checkbox" class="bit-input" value={i} checked={i===0||i===3}/></label>)}</div></fieldset><output id="bits-result" class="tool-result" aria-live="polite"></output><p class="tool-hint">用于计算掩码。写入寄存器前，请核对芯片参考手册中各位的访问属性。</p></section>
</div></section><style>.bit-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:7px}.bit-label{display:flex!important;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border:1px solid #3e4b3d;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px!important}.bit-input{width:19px!important;height:19px;accent-color:#b5ef80;margin:10px 0 5px}@media(max-width:400px){.bit-controls{gap:4px}.bit-label{font-size:10px!important}}</style><script>
import {convertBase,timer,crc16Modbus} from '../../lib/tools.mjs';
const value=(id:string)=>(document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement).value;
function result(id:string,fn:()=>string){const output=document.getElementById(id)!;try{output.textContent=fn();output.classList.remove('error');}catch(error){output.textContent=(error as Error).message;output.classList.add('error');}}
function updateBase(){result('base-result',()=>{const r=convertBase(value('base-value'),Number(value('radix')));return `HEX  ${r.hex}\nDEC  ${r.decimal}\nBIN  ${r.binary}\nOCT  ${r.octal}`;});}
function updateTimer(){result('timer-result',()=>{if(['timer-clock','timer-psc','timer-arr'].some(id=>!value(id).trim()))throw Error('请填写全部定时器参数。');const r=timer(Number(value('timer-clock')),Number(value('timer-psc')),Number(value('timer-arr')));return `更新频率  ${Number(r.frequency.toPrecision(10))} Hz\n更新周期  ${Number(r.periodMs.toPrecision(10))} ms`;});}
function updateCrc(){result('crc-result',()=>{const r=crc16Modbus(value('crc-data'));return `CRC  0x${r.hex}\n发送顺序  ${r.wire}\n数据长度  ${r.count} 字节`;});}
function updateBits(){const bits=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('.bit-input:checked')].map(b=>Number(b.value));const mask=bits.reduce((a,b)=>a|(1<<b),0);document.getElementById('bits-result')!.textContent=`HEX  0x${mask.toString(16).toUpperCase().padStart(2,'0')}\nBIN  ${mask.toString(2).padStart(8,'0')}\nC    ${bits.length?bits.map(b=>`(1U << ${b})`).join(' | '):'0U'}`;}
['radix','base-value'].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id)!.addEventListener('input',updateBase));['timer-clock','timer-psc','timer-arr'].forEach(id=>document.getElementById(id)!.addEventListener('input',updateTimer));document.getElementById('crc-data')!.addEventListener('input',updateCrc);document.querySelectorAll('.bit-input').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('change',updateBits));updateBase();updateTimer();updateCrc();updateBits();
</script></Layout>
